post_install() {
  cat <<'EOF'
VirtoMir services are not started automatically. To enable them:
  sudo systemctl enable --now libvirtd.service
  sudo systemctl enable --now virtomird.service

Web UI: https://<host-address>:8420 (self-signed certificate).
Sign in as root or an administrator in the wheel, sudo or libvirt group.
The service runs as root and listens on all network interfaces by default.
To restrict access to localhost, run:
  sudo systemctl edit virtomird.service
and add:
  [Service]
  ExecStart=
  ExecStart=/usr/bin/virtomird -listen 127.0.0.1:8420
Then run:
  sudo systemctl restart virtomird.service

PAM authentication follows /etc/pam.d/system-auth.
After upgrades, merge /etc/pam.d/virtomir.pacnew if present and restart
virtomird.service to use the updated binary. Services are not restarted
by this package.
EOF
}

post_upgrade() {
  post_install
}
